---
// The launcher and Marah OS, side by side.
---

<section class="wrap max-w-[980px] pt-22 pb-6" id="which" aria-labelledby="which-title">
  <h2 class="mt-4 mb-3 text-center text-section" id="which-title" data-reveal>
    Which one is for you?
  </h2>
  <div class="mt-8 overflow-x-auto" data-reveal>
    <table class="compare">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th scope="col">
            <span class="visually-hidden">Question</span>
          </th>
          <th scope="col">Marah Launcher</th>
          <th scope="col">Marah OS</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <th scope="row">Runs on</th>
          <td>Linux, macOS and Windows</td>
          <td>A 64-bit PC (x86-64)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th scope="row">Your desktop and apps</th>
          <td>Stay as they are</td>
          <td>Gone from the disk you pick, or kept with your own partitions</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th scope="row">Starts straight into your games</th>
          <td>With the Marah Launcher session on Linux</td>
          <td>Yes</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th scope="row">Try before installing</th>
          <td>It's an app: open it</td>
          <td>From a USB stick</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th scope="row">Updates itself</th>
          <td>Yes</td>
          <td>Yes, the whole system</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th scope="row">You need</th>
          <td>A 64-bit computer</td>
          <td>A 64-bit PC and a USB stick of 4&nbsp;GB</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
      <tfoot>
        <tr>
          <td></td>
          <td>
            <a class="cta small" href="#get">
              Get the launcher
            </a>
          </td>
          <td>
            <a class="cta small" href="https://github.com/MarahHQ/marah-os/releases/latest">
              Get Marah OS
            </a>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </tfoot>
    </table>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-5 hidden grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 max-sm:grid">
    <a class="cta max-sm:px-2.5 max-sm:py-[13px] max-sm:text-small max-sm:whitespace-nowrap" href="#get">
      Get the launcher
    </a>
    <a
      class="cta max-sm:px-2.5 max-sm:py-[13px] max-sm:text-small max-sm:whitespace-nowrap"
      href="https://github.com/MarahHQ/marah-os/releases/latest"
    >
      Get Marah OS
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
